@Web_HostAddress = http://localhost:5249

### Obtener todos los usuarios
GET {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/user
Accept: application/json

###

### Crear un usuario
POST {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Mati",
    "email": "franco@gmail.com",
    "role": "user"
}

###

### Eliminar usuario con ID 1
DELETE {{Web_HostAddress}}/api/user/1